ation, pure and simple. So to summarize: Yes, soaking happens on porous ground. But evaporation is a separate, real process that occurs at all temperatures—even on cold days. The sun just speeds it up. You can prove it to yourself with a dish on concrete on a chilly day. I encourage you to try it!
